name: elementor-widget
description: "Generates a new Elementor widget with PHP, JS, and CSS scaffolding"
variables:
  - widget_name
  - features
prompt: |
  Create a fully functional Elementor widget named "{{widget_name}}".
  Include PHP registration code, JS frontend interactions, and minimal CSS styling.
  Features: {{features}}.
  Provide clear comments in the code.
